      "body": {
        "en": "To describe a person, ask *jaki on jest?* or *jaka ona jest?* and answer with an adjective in the same gender: *on jest wesoły*, *ona jest wesoła*. *Wysoki* and *niski* end in *-i* after *k*, like *polski*: *wysoka*, *niska*."
